ame":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[53,54,83,78,95,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1010702","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":["WJ10040"]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[53,54,83,78,95,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1010702","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10040","city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[53,54,83,78,95,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1010702","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1000308","name":{"zh":"大乔完婚","en":"Da Qiao's Wedding"},"year":"199","month":"12","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1000212","name":{"zh":"并蒂双姝","en":"Twin Blossoms"},"year":"198","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"孙策率军进入庐江，结识乔老，但美若天仙的二乔，却因即将到来婚事苦恼…\n\n禁忌条件：主角为孙策，周瑜时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【主角为男性】，【身属孙策势力（信义契约身份无效）】，【庐江属孙策】，【与孙策的关系等级至少为2级且不足5级】，【与周瑜的关系等级不足5级】，【与大乔小乔的关系等级不足2级】，【大乔与小乔未拥有配偶】\n\n逆天改命：【代替周瑜娶小乔，或同时迎娶大小乔】","en":"Sun Ce leads his army into Lujiang and becomes acquainted with Elder Qiao, yet the peerless Two Qiaos are distressed over their impending marriages...\n\n\n\nRestrictions: Cannot trigger if protagonist is Sun Ce or Zhou Yu.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Protagonist is male】, 【Belong to Sun Ce's Faction (Pact of Faith status is invalid)】, 【Lujiang belongs to Sun Ce】, 【Relationship level with Sun Ce is at least Level 2 and below Level 5】, 【Relationship level with Zhou Yu is below Level 5】, 【Relationship level with Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao is below Level 2】, 【Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao have no Spouse】\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Marry Xiao Qiao in place of Zhou Yu, or marry both Da Qiao and Xiao Qiao】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"孙策的夫人，庐江郡皖县人，桥公之女，和妹妹小乔都是江东著名的美女。曾令曹操发出“吾一愿扫平四海，以成帝业；一愿得江东二乔，置之铜雀台，以乐晚年，虽死无恨！”孙策遇刺身亡后，大乔与吴夫人继续辅佐其弟孙权。","tc":"孫策的夫人，廬江郡皖縣人，橋公之女，和妹妹小喬都是江東著名的美女。曾令曹操發出“吾一愿掃平四海，以成帝業；一愿得江東二喬，置之銅雀臺，以樂晚年，雖死無恨！”孫策遇刺身亡后，大喬與吳夫人繼續輔佐其弟孫權。","en":"Wife of Sun Ce, a native of Wan County in Lujiang, and daughter of Lord Qiao. She and her younger sister Xiao Qiao were both celebrated beauties of Jiangdong. She once prompted Cao Cao to exclaim: ‘First, I wish to sweep clean the four seas to establish an empire, second, I wish to obtain the Two Qiaos of Jiangdong and install them in the Bronze Sparrow Terrace to delight my twilight years, and though I die, I shall have no regrets!’ After Sun Ce was assassinated, Da Qiao and Lady Wu continued to support his younger brother Sun Quan.","jp":"孫策の妻。廬江郡皖県の人。橋公の娘で、妹の小喬とともに江東屈指の美女として知られた。かつて曹操に「我が願いは、一つには四海を平定して帝業を成すこと、もう一つには江東の二喬を得て銅雀台に迎え、晩年を楽しむこと。それが叶えば死すとも悔いなし！」と言わしめたほどである。孫策が刺客に倒れた後は、呉夫人とともにその弟・孫権を補佐し続けた。","kr":"손책의 부인이자 여강군 완현 사람으로, 교공의 딸이다. 동생 소교와 함께 강동에서 이름난 미녀였다. 일찍이 조조로 하여금 '내 첫 번째 소원은 사해를 평정하여 제업을 이루는 것이요, 두 번째 소원은 강동의 이교를 얻어 동작대에 두고 만년을 즐기는 것이니, 그리된다면 죽어도 여한이 없겠노라!'라고 탄식하게 만들기도 했다. 손책이 암살당해 목숨을 잃은 뒤, 대교는 오부인과 함께 손책의 아우 손권을 계속해서 보좌했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10086","remark":"","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"大乔","nameTc":"大喬","nameEn":"Da Qiao","nameJp":"大喬","nameKr":"대교","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"大乔","power":"WJ10038","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"199","city":"CS10